  conclusionEyebrow:"Personal synthesis", conclusionTitle:"AI raises the value of judgement", conclusionText:"The most durable skill is not generating more code. It is knowing what to delegate, what to verify and when a human decision must remain in control.", conclusionLink:"View my projects"
