  learningEyebrow:"05 — BTS skills", learningTitle:"Technical concepts applied", learningOneTitle:"TypeScript tooling", learningOneText:"Initialise an npm project, configure TypeScript and Webpack, organise modules and transpile code for the browser.", learningTwoTitle:"Object-oriented programming", learningTwoText:"Use parent and child classes, virtual methods, interfaces, polymorphism and a prototype-style figure factory.", learningThreeTitle:"DOM & Canvas events", learningThreeText:"Read pointer coordinates, respond to clicks and redraw model data through CanvasRenderingContext2D.",
